# Precompiled x64 dependency .lib files ARE committed so the repo builds out of the box
# (matching how the 32-bit libs were tracked). cryptlib-Release.lib (~42 MB) IS committed.
# Kept out of git:
#   - cryptlib-Debug.lib (~158 MB) : exceeds GitHub's 100 MB blob limit, and LFS uploads
#     are blocked on public forks, so it cannot be vendored here. Rebuild it from
#     Lead-Extern/lib/README.md (or attach it to a GitHub Release).
#   - DLLs / PDBs / export libs : runtime/debug artifacts, not needed to build.
cryptlib-Debug.lib
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exp
